      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The village’s name honors Cadwell Evans, who in 1811 laid out streets and lots that became the town’s first grid.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        25,
        26,
        27
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
